 "intro_zh": "武当山是著名的道教圣地、国家重点风景名胜区，古建筑群被列入世界文化遗产。武当山风光旖旎、山川秀美、众峰嵯岈，而且常年紫气氤氲、云霞迷溕，除了规模宏大的古建筑群，还有博大精深的武术和源远流长的道教文化，尽显神秘空灵气质。",
 "intro_en": "Wudang Mountain is a famous Taoist holy land and a national key scenic spot. Its ancient buildings are listed as world cultural heritage. Wudang Mountain has beautiful scenery, beautiful mountains and rivers, and craggy peaks. It is also filled with purple air and misty clouds all year round. In addition to the large-scale ancient buildings, it also has extensive and profound martial arts and long-standing Taoist culture, showing its mysterious and ethereal temperament.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
